":class:`litegram.methods.promote_chat_member.PromoteChatMember`"
msgstr ""
"экземпляр метода "
":class:`litegram.methods.promote_chat_member.PromoteChatMember`"

#: litegram.types.chat.Chat.restrict:1 of
msgid ""
"Shortcut for method "
