msgstr ""
"Сокращение для метода :class:`litegram.methods.set_chat_photo.SetChatPhoto` —"
" автоматически заполнит атрибуты метода:"

#: litegram.types.chat.Chat.set_photo:6 of
msgid ""
"Use this method to set a new profile photo for the chat. Photos can't be "
"changed for private chats. The bot must be an administrator in the chat for "
"this to work and must have the appropriate administrator rights. Returns "
":code:`True` on success."
msgstr ""
